WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:23.646
Prince Eric untied the boat.

2
00:00:23.646 --> 00:00:27.909
"We can fix the leak with straw," Tom said.

3
00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:34.076
They fixed the leak.

4
00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:38.347
Then they sailed out to sea.

5
00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:43.978
Tom threw a net into the water.

6
00:00:43.978 --> 00:00:55.901
"Now we wait for fish," he said.

7
00:00:55.902 --> 00:01:06.698
The prince got bored. "Let's play pirate!"

8
00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:10.796
The prince made an eye patch.

9
00:01:10.796 --> 00:01:13.796
He put Frog on his shoulder.

10
00:01:13.796 --> 00:01:31.435
"Arr!" cried the prince.

11
00:01:31.435 --> 00:01:35.947
Soon the prince was bored again.

12
00:01:35.947 --> 00:01:39.538
"Now what can we do?" he asked.

13
00:01:39.538 --> 00:01:43.600
"Play hide-and-seek with Frog?" Tom said.

14
00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:49.476
"Okay!" said the prince.

15
00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:56.774
Frog hid.

16
00:01:56.774 --> 00:02:05.231
The prince looked all over the boat.

17
00:02:05.231 --> 00:02:09.171
"I can't find Frog," the prince said.

18
00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:12.586
"This is a boring game."

19
00:02:12.586 --> 00:02:15.899
Then the prince saw Cat.

20
00:02:15.899 --> 00:02:19.575
"I want to play with Cat!" he said.

21
00:02:19.576 --> 00:02:22.511
Cat hissed.

22
00:02:22.511 --> 00:02:27.745
"That is not a good idea," she said to Tom.

23
00:02:27.745 --> 00:02:30.662
"I have a plan," Tom said.

24
00:02:30.662 --> 00:02:32.934
He waved his wand.

25
00:02:32.934 --> 00:02:39.351
"I wish for fish!"

26
00:02:39.352 --> 00:02:43.869
The boat rocked.

27
00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:48.649
The prince ran to the net.

28
00:02:48.649 --> 00:02:52.870
"I see hundreds of fish!" he cried.

29
00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:57.632
Tom and the prince pulled in the net.

30
00:02:57.632 --> 00:03:04.769
The boat tipped.

31
00:03:04.769 --> 00:03:08.568
"The net is too heavy!" Tom cried.

32
00:03:08.568 --> 00:03:14.779
Water poured into the boat.

33
00:03:14.779 --> 00:03:19.422
"The boat is sinking!" cried Tom.

34
00:03:19.422 --> 00:03:21.741
The prince looked scared.

35
00:03:21.742 --> 00:03:29.326
"Oh no! I can't swim!"
